{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jHeNHixyA04aYaTNprzQNQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.896662+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jHeNHixyA04aYaTNprzQNQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/yUfYABW242fmaicHjC0uzMvXFXiaTHmfEv6Rc99c6NT4ulfEerbWN5xUxkReCgibKHkFvNcLIzGbIicZ1jeOPyz8RWgSJMFunrgiaiazBKSejicjnk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>同济大学工程智能研究院2027年接收</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>推荐免试研究生（含直接攻博）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>预报名通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2027</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>同济大学工程智能研究院（Institute of AI for Engineering，IAIE）是同济大学引领工程智能全过程、规模化创新而设立的校级战略性新型研发机构。研究院以“创新工程智能科技，创变工程学科发展，创造新质生产力”为使命驱动，依托同济大学的工程学科集群优势，通过系统性体制机制创新，打造教育、科技、人才三位一体的产教融合型智能研究平台，为工程领域的智能革新提供坚实支撑，打造人工智能前沿技术与现代工程技术深度融合的全球工程智能研究与创新高地。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/yUfYABW242fOEWCzIgmmhSj920CIWHu06TX4af1bN9BqGCNphBy8RmnbqtH4lB26yE6m90sce01oOF0BSHbWrZtliasNtIt6ib2lFVjia4ibecU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为推动人工智能前沿技术赋能工程领域创新发展，全面落实学校“数智化、绿色化、融合化”转型发展战略，强化工程智能领域人才培养与科研创新能力，经学校批准，</span><strong><span>研究院正式设立“工程智能专项”招生计划</span></strong><span>。</span></span><span><span>本专项计划依托计算机科学与技术学院/机械工程与机器人学院招收博士及硕士研究生，录取学生在计算机科学与技术学院/机械工程与机器人学院注册学籍，达到毕业和学位授予要求者，由计算机科学与技术学院/机械工程与机器人学院颁发毕业证书并授予学位。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>师资团队与研究方向</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>工程智能专项计划导师团队由华先胜教授领衔，现有教授、副教授及以上职称教师7名。研究团队依托真实工程场景，开展项目驱动与问题导向的科研训练，推动科学创新与工程落地的深度融合。研究方向涵盖多模态工程大模型、人机互信的工程智能体、自主工程具身智能、空间感知与三维建模、融合物理规律的可解释人工智能、脑电语义解析与虚拟细胞建模等领域。</span></p><p><span>导师团队具备扎实的学术积累与丰富的产业实践经验，核心成员曾任职于微软、阿里、华为等行业领军企业，长期深耕工程智能、人工智能与计算机应用领域，取得多项具有行业影响力的高水平成果，并熟悉产业发展需求与技术转化路径。学生将有机会参与国家级科研项目与产业合作课题，系统提升跨学科研究能力与复杂工程系统问题解决能力。导师团队通过学术研究与工程实践的协同指导，培养具备创新能力、工程能力与产业理解的复合型领军人才，为高层次人才培养提供坚实支撑。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>点击查看<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzk5MDgzNzU4Mg==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4511290618849230855#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究院师资队伍</a></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>点击查看<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzk5MDgzNzU4Mg==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4236967885534658573#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究院研究进展</a></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本专项依托托计算机科学与技术学院/机械工程与机器人学院开展招生，具体申请要求、报名及选拔流程以相关学院要求为准。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>有意报考工程智能专项的考生请在报名时“专项计划”下选择“工程智能专项”。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>相关链接</span></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>计算机科学与技术学院</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkzMzgyNTczMg==&amp;mid=2247493385&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=21f88afcc6cbe0c76ff1f7